      "extra": {
        "message": "DOCTYPE declarations are enabled for factory. Without prohibiting external entity declarations, this is vulnerable to XML external entity attacks. Disable this by setting the feature \"http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl\" to true. Alternatively, allow DOCTYPE declarations and only prohibit external entities declarations. This can be done by setting the features \"http://xml.org/sax/features/external-general-entities\" and \"http://xml.org/sax/features/external-parameter-entities\" to false.",
